    the finding willing to use power wheelchair at home about Fay is established, according to the treating practitioner.
    the finding qualifying group 3 diagnosis about Fay is established, according to the treating practitioner, because "multiple sclerosis".
    the finding single power option justified about Fay is established, according to the physical therapist.
    Fay had a specialty evaluation by a licensed medical professional with no financial relationship with the supplier for the rehab chair.
    a RESNA certified assistive technology professional employed by the supplier was directly involved in the selection of the rehab chair.
    the weight of Fay is 150 pounds.
    rn expects answers ["claim 1 is reasonable and necessary", "claim 2 is reasonable and necessary"].

